---
import service from '../data/elevator-service.json';
---
<section class="container elevator-service-card" aria-labelledby="elevator-child-service-title">
  <figure><a href={'/'+service.slug+'/'} aria-label={service.title}><img src={service.heroImage.src} alt={service.heroImage.alt} title={service.heroImage.title} width={service.heroImage.width} height={service.heroImage.height} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a></figure>
  <div><p class="elevator-service-kicker">Dịch vụ thuộc Decal quảng cáo</p><h2 id="elevator-child-service-title"><a href={'/'+service.slug+'/'}>{service.title}</a></h2><p>Hai giải pháp cho thang máy: dán film nội thất để làm mới bề mặt và decal in ấn để quảng bá thương hiệu.</p><a href={'/'+service.slug+'/'} class="btn-idecal-bold">Xem giải pháp & quy trình thi công →</a></div>
</section>
<style>
.elevator-service-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.65fr) minmax(0,1.35fr);gap:40px;align-items:center;padding-block:38px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4eaf0}.elevator-service-card figure{margin:0;aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.elevator-service-card figure>a{display:block;height:100%}.elevator-service-card img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;background:#f5f8fa}.elevator-service-kicker{font-size:12px;color:#52677c;margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:10px;border-left:3px solid #93bad8}.elevator-service-card h2{font-size:26px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 16px}.elevator-service-card div>p:not(.elevator-service-kicker){font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 20px}@media(max-width:767px){.elevator-service-card{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;padding-block:30px}.elevator-service-card h2{font-size:24px}}
</style>
